# PROJECT: GharSetu — Premium Real Estate Marketplace for Urban India

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, product architect, real-estate marketplace specialist, database designer, UI/UX designer, and QA engineer.

Build a complete, production-oriented, responsive real-estate marketplace named GharSetu.

Tagline: "Your Dream Home. Every Deal. One Destination."

This must be a functional full-stack web application, not a static landing page, UI prototype, or collection of non-functional buttons.

The platform serves citizens, tenants, property buyers, property owners, brokers, and administrators in urban India.

The key differentiator is the ability to associate multiple broker offers with the same property and allow citizens to compare rent or sale prices, brokerage fees, deposits, availability, and other applicable charges.

Prioritize data correctness, security, clear navigation, premium design, and working functionality.

Do not claim that external services are working until they have been configured and tested.

